<workout_file>
    <author>Coach Library</author>
    <name>Over-Unders L01 - Intro 2x8 (85/92)</name>
    <description>PICK THIS WHEN: Introduction to over-unders: small over/under gap. Start here even if your threshold level is higher.
DAY TYPE: HARD.

Over-Unders - level 1 of 10. Intro 2x8 (85/92).

Structure: 10 min warm-up, 4 x (1 min @ 85% / 1 min @ 92%), 5 min @ 55%, 4 x (1 min @ 85% / 1 min @ 92%), 24 min @ 65%, 5 min cool-down.

Coach notes: Learn the rhythm: 1 min at 85%, 1 min at 92%. Nothing above sweet spot yet. The over creates lactate, the under trains your body to clear it while still working - never coast after an over.

Estimated TSS: 49.</description>
    <sportType>bike</sportType>
    <tags>
        <tag name="Over-Under"/>
        <tag name="Level 1"/>
    </tags>
    <workout>
        <Warmup Duration="600" PowerLow="0.45" PowerHigh="0.80">
            <textevent timeoffset="0" message="Over-under session. Warm up properly - the first block starts at the top of sweet spot."/>
            <textevent timeoffset="480" message="2 minutes to the first block. Lift the effort slightly."/>
        </Warmup>
        <IntervalsT Repeat="4" OnDuration="60" OffDuration="60" OnPower="0.85" OffPower="0.92">
            <textevent timeoffset="0" message="UNDER: 1 min at 85%. Hold it - this is still work, no coasting."/>
            <textevent timeoffset="60" message="OVER: 1 min at 92%. Push, then settle straight back to the under."/>
        </IntervalsT>
        <SteadyState Duration="300" Power="0.55">
            <textevent timeoffset="0" message="Recover: 5 min easy. Drink."/>
        </SteadyState>
        <IntervalsT Repeat="4" OnDuration="60" OffDuration="60" OnPower="0.85" OffPower="0.92">
            <textevent timeoffset="0" message="UNDER: 1 min at 85%. Hold it - this is still work, no coasting."/>
            <textevent timeoffset="60" message="OVER: 1 min at 92%. Push, then settle straight back to the under."/>
        </IntervalsT>
        <SteadyState Duration="1440" Power="0.65">
            <textevent timeoffset="0" message="Main set done. 24 min of steady Zone 2 at 65% to finish - relaxed but not soft."/>
        </SteadyState>
        <Cooldown Duration="300" PowerLow="0.60" PowerHigh="0.45">
            <textevent timeoffset="0" message="Well done. Cool down easy."/>
        </Cooldown>
    </workout>
</workout_file>
